Y        EQU   1000
OUT      EQU   1100
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT5  24
         ENT6  55
         ENT4  0
1H       LDA   Y,6       A1. Add.
         ADD   Y,5       Yk + Yj (overflow possible)
         STA   Y,6       → Yk.
         DEC5  1         A2. Advance. j ← j − 1.
         DEC6  1         k ← k − 1.
         J5P   *+2
         ENT5  55        If j = 0, set j ← 55.
         J6P   *+2
         ENT6  55        If k = 0, set k ← 55.
         STA   OUT,4
         INC4  1
         CMP4  =10=
         JL    1B
         HLT
         END   START
